			    "Over the 10-year period from 2015 to 2024, livability has shown " & FORMAT(ABS(TenYearChange), "0.0") & " points " & TenYearDirection & " from " & FORMAT(Value2015, "0.0") & ". " &
			    "The card includes a sparkline showing the historical trend from 2015 to 2024. " &
			    "A people icon represents livability and quality of life. Higher values indicate better livability."
			
			RETURN
