			        <div style='font-size: 11px; color: #4A9B9B; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;'>✨ Key Takeaways:</div>
			        <div style='font-size: 10px; color: #b8c5d6; line-height: 1.4;'>
			            • Radar shows all 5 dimensions<br>
			            • Review performance insights<br>
			            • Check dimension cards & sparklines<br>
			            • Monitor overall baseline<br>
			            • Hover cards for explanations
			        </div>
			    </div>
			    
			    <div style='
			        background: rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.15);
			        border: 1px solid rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.3);
			        border-radius: 4px;
			        padding: 10px;
			        margin-bottom: 12px;
			        display: flex;
